rce_missing","gap_id":"gap_24_nonclinical","missing_source_classes":["非临床研究摘要","受体选择性数据","动物模型疗效数据"],"target":"2.4 本研究的理论基础"},{"action":"请提供CKD-aP瘙痒病理机制及κ/μ阿片受体失衡假说的关键文献，以支撑理论基础中关于疾病机制的论述。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_24_mechanism_lit","missing_source_classes":["CKD-aP病理机制文献","κ阿片受体与瘙痒信号通路综述"],"target":"2.4 本研究的理论基础"}],"heading":"本研究的理论基础","missing_source_classes":["KRX-203非临床研究数据（受体选择性、外周限制性验证、动物模型疗效）","CKD-aP瘙痒病理机制详细文献","同类κ阿片受体激动剂III期研究具体数据"],"proposal_text":"慢性肾病相关瘙痒（CKD-aP）是维持性血液透析患者中常见的难治性症状，其病理机制涉及外周感觉神经末梢中κ阿片受体与μ阿片受体之间的失衡。κ阿片受体激动可抑制瘙痒信号的传入传导，而μ阿片受体过度激活则与瘙痒感知增强相关。KRX-203为外周限制性κ阿片受体激动剂，其设计目标在于选择性激动外周κ阿片受体以减轻瘙痒，同时通过限制中枢穿透降低中枢神经系统相关不良反应风险。本研究为II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，旨在在维持性血液透析CKD-aP人群中初步验证KRX-203的抗瘙痒药效，探索0.25mg每日两次与0.5mg每日两次两个剂量水平的剂量-反应关系，并为后续确证性研究确定推荐剂量提供依据。同类外周限制性κ阿片受体激动剂在透析人群中的已发表III期研究（静脉剂型）阳性结果为本研究的疗效假设提供了外部支持。","rationale":"靶点机制（κ阿片受体激动剂、外周限制性）、研究目的（药理/药效探索、概念验证、剂量探索）、适应症人群（维持性血液透析CKD-aP）、剂量方案（0.25mg BID、0.5mg BID）及同类药物III期阳性引用均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。外周限制性降低中枢不良反应的表述为基于'外周限制性'设计特征的合理推断，需核实是否有非临床数据支持。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_304b0bd769bbd705","section_number":"2.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f4d819547133c17d4c5abebc","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010035550_fe3b44fb","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"主要终点：第8周瘙痒WI-NRS周平均值较基线下降≥4分的受试者比例","quote_sha256":"39d77f2c1f312fbde1ade6b504599cd79b59ba24a45d5388db5e1b0592a49b4b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"W2/W4/W6/W8 WI-NRS周平均值较基线变化；EASI无关；睡眠质量（JSQ-BM）与生活质量（Skindex-17或DLQI）较基线变化；应答维持时间；安全性终点（TEAE/SAE发生率、生命体征、实验室检查、12导联ECG）","quote_sha256":"0f827edb7e587100d7d66b7b052ef31b2aa7d150ecaa6024fab664622b4b675f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"探索性目的：探索剂量-反应关系及PK特征","quote_sha256":"5c0e21e442845619befa123d1e1a76129f9548bea4fba3ddb8abe1aa30819344","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"探索性终点：血药浓度与瘙痒改善的暴露-效应关系","quote_sha256":"6a3d4db1653e1642659158210b63d390a185fa01e10602427c3ae7a87c802896","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"主要研究目的：评估口服KRX-203治疗维持性血液透析慢性肾病相关瘙痒患者的疗效（瘙痒强度较基线改善）。次要目的：评估KRX-203的安全性、耐受性及对睡眠质量和生活质量的影响。","quote_sha256":"7c80c02836e827a28f5a994e06dc22bcbf57d02041a0286883514767753eabd3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_009"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"适应症：慢性肾病相关瘙痒（CKD-aP，维持性血液透析人群）","quote_sha256":"7d8ff96e6bbd253d3e5991976ca087e5cd7ce40edc29f6ac2a9360d147b38ebb","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_010"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"试验药物：KRX-203片","quote_sha256":"639197f13496980dd95a98ff4aa080b8e2dcea6e002ec4a68d0dc85e1c77ea7d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_012"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_013"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_004","es_005","es_006","es_007","es_009","es_010","es_012","es_013"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":8},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究目的和终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的主要目的是评估口服KRX-203片治疗维持性血液透析慢性肾病相关瘙痒患者的疗效，以瘙痒强度较基线改善为核心评价指标。主要终点为第8周（D56）瘙痒WI-NRS周平均值较基线下降≥4分的受试者比例。次要研究目的为评估KRX-203的安全性、耐受性及对睡眠质量和生活质量的影响。次要终点包括：第2周、第4周、第6周、第8周WI-NRS周平均值较基线变化；睡眠质量（JSQ-BM）较基线变化；生活质量（Skindex-17或DLQI）较基线变化；应答维持时间；安全性终点（TEAE/SAE发生率、生命体征、实验室检查、12导联ECG）。探索性研究目的为探索剂量-反应关系及药代动力学特征，探索性终点为血药浓度与瘙痒改善的暴露-效应关系。","rationale":"主要目的、次要目的、探索性目的及全部终点（WI-NRS主要终点、W2/W4/W6/W8 WI-NRS变化、JSQ-BM、Skindex-17或DLQI、应答维持时间、TEAE/SAE、生命体征、实验室检查、12导联ECG、暴露-效应关系）均直接来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。Skindex-17与DLQI以'或'连接，最终量表选择待核实。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究目的和终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_58dbc7cd9cc5e21f","section_number":"3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f4d819547133c17d4c5abebc","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010035550_fe3b44fb","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"探索性目的：探索剂量-反应关系及PK特征","quote_sha256":"5c0e21e442845619befa123d1e1a76129f9548bea4fba3ddb8abe1aa30819344","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"探索性终点：血药浓度与瘙痒改善的暴露-效应关系","quote_sha256":"6a3d4db1653e1642659158210b63d390a185fa01e10602427c3ae7a87c802896","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照、三剂量组（0.25mg BID/0.5mg BID/安慰剂1:1:1）设计；血液透析人群口服给药8周+2周安全随访","quote_sha256":"48c9e0c0ad2538f7e5aeaabb978a1bd477511dc919acf411e5b410aa4ad437a3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_008"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"剂量与给药方案：KRX-203片：0.25mg BID（每日两次，每次1片，0.25mg规格）；0.5mg BID（每日两次，每次1片，0.5mg规格）；疗程8周；无负荷剂量","quote_sha256":"154f8b5a4e8fa09b8d19a30b40028494140ff625f6dd8c5e40bf7f15aa4d0221","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_014"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_6d9208d7233030ca:full-draft:f4d819547133c17d4c5abebc","quote":"探索剂量-反应关系及PK特征\n血药浓度与瘙痒改善的暴露-效应关系","quote_sha256":"86e5ffa1e91eba3cef87a57d50ae53639a4b197399ce3a44009dc7f14bdca934","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:f4d819547133c17d4c5abebc","span_id":"es_018"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_006","es_007","es_008","es_014","es_018"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"请提供PK采样时间点方案（含透析日与非透析日采样安排）及暴露-效应分析模型方法，以完善探索性终点中PK特征描述。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_33_pk_sampling","missing_source_classes":["PK采样方案","暴露-效应分析模型"],"target":"3.3 探索性目的和探索性终点"},{"action":"请确认剂量-反应关系的统计检验方法（如趋势检验、模型拟合等），以完善探索性目的中剂量-反应关系的描述。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_33_dose_response_method","missing_source_classes":["剂量-反应关系统计方法"],"target":"3.3 探索性目的和探索性终点"},{"action":"请确认生活质量量表最终选择为Skindex-17还是DLQI（当前来源以'或'连接），以便在正文中明确唯一量表名称。","category":"decision_pending","gap_id":"gap_33_qol_scale","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"3.3 探索性目的和探索性终点"}],"heading":"探索性目的和探索性终点","missing_source_classes":["PK采样时间点方案","暴露-效应分析模型方法","剂量-反应关系统计检验方法"],"proposal_text":"本研究的探索性目的为探索KRX-203的剂量-反应关系及药代动力学特征。探索性终点为血药浓度与瘙痒改善的暴露-效应关系。本研究设置0.25mg每日两次与0.5mg每日两次两个活性剂量组及安慰剂组，通过比较不同剂量组间第8周WI-NRS应答率及WI-NRS周平均值较基线变化，初步探索剂量-反应关系。药代动力学特征通过采集血药浓度数据，分析KRX-203在维持性血液透析人群中的暴露参数，并建立血药浓度与瘙痒改善之间的暴露-效应关系模型，为后续确证性研究的剂量选择提供药代动力学依据。","rationale":"探索性目的（剂量-反应关系及PK特征）和探索性终点（血药浓度与瘙痒改善的暴露-效应关系）直接来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。剂量组设置（0.25mg BID、0.5mg BID、安慰剂）及主要终点（WI-NRS）为已确认设计事实。暴露-效应分析的具体模型方法、PK采样时间点及剂量-反应关系的统计检验方法需药代动力学和统计团队确认。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（剂量选择）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_36c32a35e239b625","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f4d819547133c17d4c5abebc","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"7f8f7e93651d9652e005c2b1baaa33cff98a500571913953d6e9f7aa6b46f078","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_6d9208d7233030ca:full-draft:f4d819547133c17d4c5abebc","role":"current_working_draft_pac